      "text_preview": "Context: Security in Amazon Elastic Container Service Function: explanation Text: Security of the cloud – AWS is responsible for protecting the infrastructure that runs AWS services in the AWS Cloud. AWS also provides you with services that you can use securely. Third-party auditors regularly test and verify the effectiveness of our security as part of the AWS compliance programs. To learn about the compliance programs that apply to Amazon Elastic Container Service, see AWS Services in Scope by Compliance Program."
